<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Suite No. 3 &quot;Kuhle Wampe&quot;, Op. 26 (Hanns Eisler)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1932</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Orchestervariationen über Eislers Solidaritätslied (Asriel, Geißler, Kirmße, Kochan, Köhler, Nowka, Werzlau, Zechlin)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1961</span><span class="sg-chain-h">variations on</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The People United Will Never Be Defeated! (Frederic Rzewski)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1975</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in (variation 26)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Interval signal of Stimme der DDR</span><span class="sg-chain-h">final two bars used as</span></li></ul></section>
